<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has intensified cross-border attacks, bombing a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and striking Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while the Myanmar military blamed resistance groups for firing into Thailand to stir conflict. The United States is linking deeper diplomatic engagement with Myanmar to access its rare-earth resources, and Japan publicly denied seeking Myanmar’s removal from the FATF blacklist. Thai officials warned that the economy could collapse without Myanmar workers, and a Thai defence chief cautioned Myanmar over the impact of border clashes. 2,332 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1JbThPZ2hhck1iUVZZMnVBR0xsN0U0c2JUVkpkZnNmRmQ5TjNLZUhhTmdqZ21BSWtZeGhielk2WnJKTFl4ME41dktCVEJTUHM5TTNhZWxSSlQ2MGky?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQQkxmQTd3VU15TVRnZk5qWUUxRVVzNUlPd1h4a2M3VWItR3hEWTdCbHRjaDZVaHNZUWVPT3FJT1o3UmxVYS1ST0dPX2pfaS1RYW85M2NpRm1DQkVVbnBtbFdaOF9UMWxjeVdnWXh1OGRRWHFlazJhbWhlRG1MZWd3d3RvOVBlSWt1X3E1bHhneWVoMGRQRzFxMEZPdEtoSDk1UEY4OTA0UjYzTV9YRW1QLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOQXIzX0ZnQllyeGc0eG9mNnlNbFVWWmdad3VOYmU2eHNwbGRmYy1IQldrbzVEaFdSQVRvYjIyb2RNdFdzRVIwU3gyNm4xbkQxbkQxUXRXNThxbFY1LWtIUVVVa2NMOGNrNVAzem9pT3JTVmctNzFTZ2V6WmY2d2hUZmRiNWhrcjRUR21FTm9lYk1HUVlGLU5jUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Japan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQTWRhTkFnRWc